"nextNodeIds":[751480506]},{"nodeId":751480506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3683716738,"text":"But, uh... *gulp* Kinda high up, aren't we?","nextNodeIds":[751480507,751480510]},{"nodeId":751480507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4052235786,"text":"Don't you worry, Paimon, I'll carry you.","nextNodeIds":[751480508]},{"nodeId":751480508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1752794346,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[751480509]},{"nodeId":751480509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":933284394,"text":"Err, you wanna go in too? Well... Ugh, alright. I—If that's the case, Paimon's not that scared anymore.","nextNodeIds":[751480514]},{"nodeId":751480514,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":971015194,"text":"And it's not just that we're high up — don't forget about the gaseous phlogiston!","nextNodeIds":[751480515]},{"nodeId":751480515,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1329893138,"text":"A—Anyway, let's make sure we're all set before we go!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751480510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2503023690,"text":"As long as you grab me just as we land...","nextNodeIds":[751480511]},{"nodeId":751480511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2625845106,"text":"Ugh, Paimon couldn't do that! Never mind the strength problem — think about the timing!","nextNodeIds":[751480512]},{"nodeId":751480512,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2556743306,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[751480513]},{"nodeId":751480513,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":62605314